Q: In order to maintain MeN / Mex what barriers does it need? 
A: Use common sense to see what fences are available on the processor and use it.
   Ideally you want the barrier that prevents just the one direction movement. Believe
   me neither SPARC nor x86 have anything like that Itanium has one but I m not sure they
   can be used in isolation.

   So you ll land up using a stronger fence in most cases.

Q: Ok what do the x86 fences look like?
